            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Trigger 1.4.3</h2><ul>
<li>Now runs on macOS Ventura (13) and later</li>
<li>A new licence check, and your existing licence key keeps working</li>
<li>A "Trigger is unlocked" screen thanks you once your licence is activated</li>
<li>Settings has a new Licence section showing your key and that it works on up to 3 Macs</li>
<li>Small fixes and polish</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
